Where a provision corresponding to the disposition of an administrative fine imposed for an offense committed (referring to cases of violating the previous Enforcement Decree of the Toxic Chemical Substances Control Act) before this Decree enters into force exists in the amended provisions of subparagraph 2 of Appendix 2, such disposition shall be included in the calculation of the number of instances of offenses under such provision.
